<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-LEADING AUSTRALIAN OPEN THIRD-ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING AUSTRALIAN OPEN THIRD-ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading third-round scores in the Australian Open at the par-72 Australian Golf Club course on Saturday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>211  Greg Norman 67 73 71</p>
<p>215  Klas Eriksson (Sweden) 68 71 76</p>
<p>217  David Smail (New Zealand) 72 73 72</p>
<p>218  Anthony Painter 72 75 71, Stephen Leaney 73 73 72</p>
<p>219  Wayne Grady 70 77 72</p>
<p>221  Grant Waite (New Zealand) 72 75 74, Jean-Louis Guepy</p>
<p>     (France) 72 74 75, David Howell (Britain) 70 75 76, Justin</p>
<p>     Cooper 72 74 75, Rolf Muntz (Netherlands) 71 71 79</p>
<p>     222 Paul McGinley (Ireland) 76 74 72, Paul Moloney 77 72 73,</p>
<p>     Tiger Woods (U.S.) 79 72 71, Marcus Cain 78 73 71, Robert</p>
<p>     Allenby 77 74 71, Lyndsay Stephen 75 73 74, Jarrod Moseley 74 74</p>
<p>     74, Robert Stephens 69 79 74, Craig Warren 73 73 76, Terry Price</p>
<p>     73 73 76, Rodger Davis 71 72 79, Richard Green 70 75 77</p>
<p>223  Steve Alker (New Zealand) 72 78 73, Jack Kay (Canada) 75 74</p>
<p>     74, Peter O'Malley 78 74 71, Brett Partridge 70 77 76.</p>
